  "title": "Zombie 1.8 m",
  "description": "A green zombie in torn shorts, arms reaching out. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 1800 mm tall (1973 x 1096 x 1800 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 10 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/zombie/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 7822 triangles.",
